# Keep dist installs (Packagist archives) lean: ship only what consumers need
# at runtime. NOT excluded on purpose:
# - dist/        -> the prebuilt frontend bundle published to public/vendor/noerd
# - docs/        -> the Boost guideline and skills point agents at docs/*.md
#   (AGENTS.md / CLAUDE.md are the contributor guide of this repository and
#   are excluded — consumers read the Boost guideline instead)
# - src/Testing/  -> the public test API for module developers ships with src/
#                   (`Noerd\Testing\ModuleTestCase` for a module's own Testbench
#                    suite, `\Noerd\Testing\HelperLoader::load()` for suites that
#                    bind another test case, the global helpers, the
#                    CreatesSetupUser concern). tests/ is the package's own
#                    suite and is excluded as a whole.
/.github            export-ignore
/tests              export-ignore
/phpunit.xml        export-ignore
/.phpunit.cache     export-ignore
/pint.json          export-ignore
/phpstan.neon.dist  export-ignore
/phpstan-baseline.neon export-ignore
/tools              export-ignore
/vite.config.js     export-ignore
/package.json       export-ignore
/package-lock.json  export-ignore
/composer.lock      export-ignore
/.gitattributes     export-ignore
/.gitignore         export-ignore
/AGENTS.md          export-ignore
/CLAUDE.md          export-ignore
